{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52653","headline":"同前 · 杨□","name":"同前","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王□重幽赏，携樽对□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n鸟鸣欺□度，人娇舞实□。\n独□□□□，□□□□□。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨□","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}